notes.content:
Hello everyone!

Update v.1.10: 


 Some textures have been changed;
 Changes with the display of character’s shadows;
 Small changes in the balance;
 Added the ability to prepare  the squad before the final battle;
 Added two achievements: "Strategist" and "Berserker".


Have a nice game! :)

Hello everyone!

New update v.1.09: 


 The "easy difficulty level" will now be even easier, as originally intended :);
 Changed the characteristics of some opponents for easing battles;
 Various small changes that should make the game more balanced in its difficulty;
 Fixed a bug where you could re-activate the dialog with Niso in the circle of stones;
 Fixed typos in the text;
 Changed the dialogs with Franc, now the logic of events is better preserved;
 Now you can buy books from Franc without participating in the experiment;
 Now after the rest before going to the castle, our heroes will be fully restored;
 Added a save-point at the beginning of the battle.


Have a nice game! :)

Hello everyone!

New update v.1.08: 

Fixed errors in the text;
Fixed inconsistencies in the appearance of heroes and their portraits;
Fixed the system for getting crystal weapons – now you can't just get additional weapons without a crystal;
Fixed the logic of dialogs with Franc – provided that the player did not communicate with him until the last moment;
Fixed a situation where the captain stayed in the bilge instead of leaving;
Fixed properties of warm cloaks - now they can't be used and disappear after;
Changes in the balance - the snow spirits have become weaker;
Fixed a bug where you could get an extra crystal from pirates;
Fixed the Troll Ring property - now you can put It on;
Various minor improvements.

Thank you for your comments and have a nice game! :)

Hello everyone!

New update v.1.07: 


 Fixed text mistakes;
 Small graphic changes - shadows are now displayed more correctly;
 Small changes in the balance - used items are now applied faster.


Thank you for your comments and have a nice game! :)

Hello everyone!

New update v.1.05: 


 Improved the structure of some maps;
 Many textures were redrawn, created, and changed;
 Improved graphics of displaying light and shade;
 Fixed software errors;
 Fixed text errors.


Have a nice game! :)

Update v.1.04: 

Improved the visual part of act 1:

 Redesigned maps;
 Redrawn textures;
 Added some new elements and items;
 New achievements "Let there some light!" and "Real mole».


Thank you all for your feedback and comments!
Have a nice game! :)

Update v.1.03: 

• Improved balance;
• By repeated requests, the frequency of random encounters on maps has been reduced. For this purpose, the conditions for the progress of characters have been reworked;
• Redrawn some textures.

Thank you all for your feedback and comments!
Have a nice game! :)

Update v.1.01: 

 Improved balance;
 Redrawn some textures;
 Fixed typos in text;
 Tunnels of the castle. Changed the hint for further passing, now it should be easier to find it.


Thank you all for your feedback and comments!
Have a nice game! :)
